# This repository is a distribution point. Releases carry the binaries; the repository does not.
#
# A 25 MB installer committed here would be in the history forever, would be re-cloned by everyone, and
# would drift out of step with the release that is actually served. If a file matching one of these appears
# in a working copy, it wandered in from a build and does not belong.
*.exe
*.msi
*.zip
*.nsis.zip
*.sig

# Signing keys. The private half decides what runs on every player's machine and must never be near a
# repository, let alone a public one. It lives in ~/.tauri. This rule is a backstop, not the control.
*.key
*.pem
*.pfx
*.p12

.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
